<html:figcaption>The TensorCore architecture</html:figcaption></html:figure>
            <html:ul>
              <html:li><html:em>Vector register file</html:em> each register is 8x128 <fr:link href="/OGCRO/" title="Vector Register" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/OGCRO/" display-uri="OGCRO" type="local">vector registers</fr:link> with 8 horizontal lanes and 128 vertical lanes. There are typically 64 of these registers.</html:li>
